#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:12
msgid "The core functionality is the secure and trusted exchange of signature keys for GDHCN Trust Network Gateway (TNG) which acts as a central repository for the public keys. GDHCN Participants are empowered to publish the public keys that they use to sign Verifiable Digital Health Certificate. Relying GDHCN Participants can use the TNG to fetch up-to-date public key material on a timely basis."
msgstr "核心功能是为 GDHCN 信任网络网关（TNG）安全、可信地交换签名密钥，TNG 充当公钥的中央存储库。GDHCN 参与方有权发布其用于为可验证数字健康证书签名的公钥。依赖方 GDHCN 参与方可以使用 TNG 及时获取最新的公钥材料。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:75
msgid "The document signer SHALL NOT sign documents that are valid longer than the DSC itself."
msgstr "文档签名者不得（SHALL NOT）签署有效期长于 DSC 本身的文档。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:213
msgid "The DSC MUST be signed with the private key corresponding to an SCA certificate that is used by the GDHCN Participant."
msgstr "DSC 必须（MUST）使用与 GDHCN 参与方所用某一 SCA 证书相对应的私钥签名。"

#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:187
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_certificate_governance.md:188
